<title>JAPAN: Heisei Polymer - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Heisei Polymer - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.72		vs	    6.65</p>
<p> Operating	  201 million	 vs	  141 million</p>
<p> Current	    185 million	 vs	  125 million</p>
<p> Net		   78 million	 vs	   48 million</p>
<p> EPS		    3.88 yen	  vs	    2.36 yen</p>
<p> Shares		20 million	 vs	   20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Heisei Polymer Co Ltd is a specialist manufacturer of synthetic resin-processed cloths.</p>
